# Optional secrets for the GitHub Codespaces demo (issue #105).
#
# Preferred: add Codespaces secrets named OPENAI_API_KEY / HF_TOKEN under
# GitHub -> Settings -> Codespaces -> Secrets; they are injected as environment
# variables automatically and never stored in the repo.
#
# For manual input, uncomment and fill the values below, then copy this file to
# deployment/codespace/.env (gitignored). start.sh sources that file on start.
# Leave everything commented to use the shipped local Qwen2.5-0.5B + MiniLM
# models - no key is required.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-REPLACE_ME
# HF_TOKEN=hf_REPLACE_ME
# GENAI_API_KEY=REPLACE_ME
